  "title": "Dentacor — §58-69-5 Enforcement Forborne",
  "content": "During the Dentacor demonstration period, the Utah Division of Professional Licensing (DOPL) forgave enforcement of unlawful and unprofessional-conduct actions under Utah Code §58-69-5 solely for conduct authorized by the RMA. The initial mitigation period ended May 31, 2026, and no public extension instrument was located as of July 25, 2026.",
